PassBook Reader

The Apple VAS command flow is adapted from android-universal-reader by kormax,
commit 8a4c887d068abe0de9ec81fd35446d01caac275c (Apache License 2.0).
https://github.com/kormax/android-universal-reader

Modifications: Java implementation, bounded BER-TLV parsing, VAS-only protocol,
fresh request nonce, encrypted-result bridge, native UI, lifecycle management,
barcode adapters and tests. This app contains no upstream demo private keys.

The upstream license is reproduced in third-party/kormax-LICENSE.
Dependencies retain their own licenses in the APK META-INF entries.
